1. What this repository contains
--------------------------------

Original work by the pikpik-2 authors, licensed MIT (see LICENSE):

    src/ include/      the host port layer — disc service, DVD/FST, ARAM,
                       memory card, audio host, J3D/J2D host paths, Metal
                       integration, record and replay
